<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.17.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.17.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.17.0 (2026-11-24): Chapter 11 release story starts. The review found that the notes and result balloons of the 19 code slides still spoke of the old several-box code, that two codes lacked an import, three titles did not match their code and one result visual was wrong. Deck 4.1.0, source 1.2.0, manifest 1.4.0 and page 9.22.0 replace deck 4.0.0 and page 9.21.0, which stay as committed and are superseded."""@en .

ex:ST11_Release_11 backlog:hasState backlog:InProgress .
ex:TK11_Release_11_Build backlog:hasState backlog:InProgress ;
    backlog:hasTransitionNote "Starts 2026-11-24 after TK11_Page_11_Verify Done (register 1.16.0)." .
ex:TK11_Deck_11_Verify backlog:hasAuditNote "Correction 2026-11-24: the checks of 1.14.0 were run on deck 4.0.0, which the review of the release story superseded by deck 4.1.0 (see 1.18.0 for the logs on 4.1.0). The check tool of the source is now code_check_v1_2_0.py with the new condition C5." .
